    "feedback": "During save, show the platform busy state and prevent a second active save. On success, keep the saved form visible and show an accessible success notification containing the non-sensitive Request Number. For missing or invalid fields, show inline control errors and a form-level summary without clearing valid input. For permission failure, state that the user is not authorised and provide the approved support route without exposing role details. For duplicate or overlapping submission, report that the save is already processing or the request was already saved and direct the agent to the visible Request Number. For a stale conflict in any future update path, preserve both versions and tell the user to reload and reconcile. For transient failure, retain form values, show a privacy-safe correlation identifier when supplied by the platform, and allow an intentional retry.",
